  "question": {
    "text": "Given an A.P. whose terms are all positive integers. The sum of its first nine terms is greater than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn></math>&nbsp;and less than&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn><mo>.</mo></math> &nbsp;If the second term in it is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math>, then its&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math> term is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>220</mn></math></p><p>As we know sum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;terms of A.P whose first term is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and common difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;&#160;200&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>220</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>As we know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term of A.P is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></math><br /><br />Also&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>8</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msub><maction actiontype=\"argument\"><mrow/></maction><mrow/></msub></msub></math><br /><br />OR&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />i.e. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>8</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
}